      {
        "id": 67561,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-09T16:38:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Your character card is indestructable. So you can't choose that.</p>\n<p>The card gives you an Either/Or choice. If you do not have 2 cards to discard, you&nbsp;<em>must</em> destroy one of your cards in play (not character card obviously). If you do not have a card in play to destroy, you&nbsp;<em>must</em> discard 2 cards. If you have no cards in play and less than 2 cards in your hand, you would discard that one card. If you have no cards in hand and none in play, well, you were in a bad spot to begin with now wernt you?&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:45:36.471Z",
